  "value": "Entity is {uuid, type: TEAM|FOLDER|FILE, userIds, children}; teams are roots, files have no children, uuids are unique. A user can access an entity iff the user is listed on it or on any ancestor. For each query [userId, uuid] return that boolean (unknown uuid -> false). The batch-query interface is an inference.",
